---
description: >-
  Numeric-timestamp variant using an uppercase "dateFormat X" (Unix
  seconds), the counterpart to the sibling fixture that uses lowercase
  "dateFormat x" (Unix milliseconds) for the same pipeline task.
---
gantt
  title Process time profile (ms)
  dateFormat X
  axisFormat %L
  tickInterval 250millisecond

  section Pipeline
  Parse JSON p1: 000, 120
